WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Could a new mRNA vaccine prevent Covid-19?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
The trial randomized 43,548 participants people aged 16 and older.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
BNT162b2 was 95% effective against Covid-19.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
162 cases with placebo. Just 8 with the vaccine.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Protection started early: 52% efficacy between the two doses.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Severe Covid-19: 9 cases with placebo, 1 with the vaccine.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Two doses of BNT162b2 gave 95% protection. N Engl J Med, 2020. Scroll for the full breakdown.
